<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Near the cross, a trembling soul,</l><l>Love and mercy found me;</l><l>There the Bright and Morning Star</l><l>Sheds its beams around me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Near the cross! O Lamb of God,</l><l>Bring its scenes before me;</l><l>Help me walk from day to day,</l><l>With its shadow o’er me.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Near the cross I’ll watch and wait,</l><l>Hoping, trusting ever,</l><l>Till I see my Savior’s face,</l><l>Leave His presence never.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
